{"gfD": [{"id": "gfD", "headword": "गृध्", "headword_slp1": "gfD", "fold": "gfD", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गृध् cl. 4. P. गृ॑ध्यति (perf. 3. pl. जगृधुर्, BhP. v, 4, 1; जागृधु॑र्, RV. ii, 23, 16; aor. अ॑गृधत्, RV. x, 34, 4; fut. गर्धिष्यति, ŚBr. iii; pr. p. गृ॑ध्यत्, RV. iv, 38, 3; ind.p. गृद्ध्वा, BhP. x, 64, 40),\nto endeavour to gain, RV. iv, 38, 3; AV. viii, 6, 1;\nto covet, desire, strive after greedily, be desirous of or eager for (loc. [RV.; AV. &c.] or acc. ĪśUp.; MBh. iv, 276; BhP. v, vi, x) :\nCaus. P. गर्धयति, to be greedy, Dhātup. xxxii, 124;\nto make desirous or greedy, Pāṇ. i, 3, 69, Kāś.;\n Ā. ˚यते, to deceive, cheat, ib.; Bhaṭṭ. viii, 43 :\nIntens. 2. sg. impf. अजर्घाः, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 14, Kāś.;", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गृध् [cf. अनु-, प्रति-; अभि-घृध्न, प्र-गर्धिन्; cf. also Old Germ. gir: Mod. Germ. gier: Engl. greedy (?) : Goth. gredags, gaurs: Hib. greadaim, ‘I burn’; greadhnach, ‘joyful, glad’; gradh, ‘love, charity; dear’; graidhneog, ‘a beloved female’, &c.: Lith. godus, gedu: Slav. glad, ‘hunger’.]", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gfDu": [{"id": "gfDu", "headword": "गृधु", "headword_slp1": "gfDu", "fold": "gfDu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गृधु mfn. libidinous, Uṇvṛ.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "गृधु m. (= गृत्स) the god of love, Uṇ. i, 24.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["गृधुः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["gfDuH"]}, {"id": "gfDU", "headword": "गृधू", "headword_slp1": "gfDU", "fold": "gfDu", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गृधू m. air voided downwards (अपान), Uṇvṛ.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "intellect (cf. MBh. v, 932), ib.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "= कुत्सित, ib.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "gfDnin": [{"id": "gfDnin", "headword": "गृध्निन्", "headword_slp1": "gfDnin", "fold": "gfDnin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "mw-cologne", "senses": [{"gloss": "गृध्निन्